<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-WAIKATO BEAT NEW SOUTH WALES 33-26.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WAIKATO BEAT NEW SOUTH WALES 33-26.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waikato Chiefs beat New South</p>
<p>Wales 33-26 (halftime 17-9) in a Super 12 rugby union match at</p>
<p>the Sydney Football Stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Waikato Chiefs - Tries: Eric Rush (2), Errol Brain.</p>
<p>Conversions: Matthew Cooper (3). Penalties: Matthew Cooper (4).</p>
<p>New South Wales - Tries: Matthew Burke, Richard Harry.</p>
<p>Conversions: Matthew Burke (2). Penalties: Matthew Burke (4).</p>
<p>Attendance: 23,076.</p>
</text>
